sequenceDiagram
  actor E as Etudiant
  participant App as React / Flutter Client
  participant API as Node.js / Express API
  participant K as Konnect Test Sandbox
  actor C as Commercant

  E->>App: Selectionne offre & valide quantite
  App->>API: POST /api/orders
  API-->>App: Commande creee (pending_payment)
  E->>App: Choisit mode Konnect (Wallet / Carte / e-Dinar)
  App->>API: POST /api/payments/konnect/init
  API->>K: Cree session paiement test
  K-->>API: paymentRef (KNT-TEST-...)
  App->>API: POST /api/payments/konnect/confirm
  API-->>App: Statut paid + qrToken + pickupCode (CS-XXXX)
  Note over E,C: A l'heure de retrait pres de l'ESSECT
  E->>C: Presente QR Code
  C->>App: Scanne ou saisit pickupCode
  App->>API: POST /api/orders/verify-qr
  API-->>App: Statut picked_up + EcoPoints (+25/+40) + Impact CO2
